Now audio.js. Let's write robust synth.

Design:

```js
export class AudioEngine {
  constructor() {
    this.ctx = null;
    this.master = null;
    this.musicBus = null;
    this.musicFilter = null;
    this.drone = null;
    this.noiseBuffer = null;
    this.muted = stored pref? 'borrowed-muted'
    this.musicTimer = null;
    this.nextNote = 0;
    this.step = 0;
    this.slow = false;
    this.enabled = true;
  }
  init() {...}
  ensure() {...}
  setMuted(m) {...persist...}
  toggleMute()
  setSlow(on) {...}
  sfx(name, opts={}) { switch }
  startMusic()
  stopMusic()
}
```

Careful about audio node garbage and errors. Wrap in try/catch.

Noise buffer: 1s white noise.

Helpers:
```
tone({type='sine', f0, f1, dur, vol, delay=0, curve='exp', filter..., pan...})
```
Implement inline per sfx for control.

Master chain: master gain -> compressor -> destination. Set master.gain=0.6. Compressor threshold -18, ratio 4.

Music chain: separate gain 0.14 -> master. Drone oscillators through lowpass with LFO. Arp notes through filter; musicFilter lowpass 1200 -> musicGain.

When slow: filter frequency 420; when normal 1600. Drone detune -? Could set `this.droneOscs.forEach(o=>o.detune.setTargetAtTime(...))`. Keep.

SFX volume should be modest. Throttle repeated hit sounds: `this.lastSfx = {}` and if now-last < 0.03 skip for hit/shoot? Shoot at 10/s; each creates nodes; okay. Add throttle 0.04.

`now()` ctx.currentTime.

Implement shoot:
```js
const t = ctx.currentTime;
const o = ctx.createOscillator(); o.type='triangle'; o.frequency.setValueAtTime(opt.od?880:620,t); o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(opt.od?280:260,t+0.09);
const g = ctx.createGain(); g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.045,t); g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001,t+0.1);
const f = ctx.createBiquadFilter(); f.type='highpass'; f.frequency.value=240;
o.connect(f).connect(g).connect(master); o.start(t); o.stop(t+0.11);
// tiny noise click for overdrive
```
Careful `exponentialRampToValueAtTime` to zero not allowed; use 0.0001.

Hit: noise buffer source, bandpass 1600, gain 0.06 decay .06.

Kill: saw 180→55 over .25 plus noise burst. 

Hurt: two oscillators low + noise; gain 0.18. Ensure not too loud.

Pickup: two sine notes (660,990) staggered.

Tick: very short triangle 1500 with gain .02 + 110 low thump.

Collector: bell: sine 140 + 210 + 297 with long decay 0.9, gain 0.05; a bit dissonant. Plus a reverse-ish swell noise.

Wave: chord 110,164.8,220,277 with saw + lowpass, envelope 0.08→0.0 over .8.

Boss: low boom.

SlowIn: noise bandpass sweep 300→1200 over .4 + low drone; gain .08. SlowOut similar reverse.

Dash: noise highpass sweep.

Victory: chord arpeggio major 261,329,392,523 over 1.2s + low.

Defeat: descending notes 196,164,130,98, each 0.25s; lowpass.

UI: 500→700 blip.

Mute: master gain set 0.0001/0.6 with ramp.

Music:
- Start drone:
```js
const droneGain = ctx.createGain(); droneGain.gain.value=0; connect to musicFilter? Actually musicFilter -> musicGain -> master.
const o1 sine 55, o2 sine 55*1.5=82.5 detuned, o3 saw 110 low gain via lowpass. Start.
droneGain.gain.linearRamp to 0.05 over 2s.
```
- arp scheduler: `setInterval(()=>this._schedule(),120)`; schedule notes until currentTime+0.3. Step duration 0.42s; pattern scale degrees [0,7,3,10,5,12,10,3] maybe. Base 130.81 (C3). Triangle with gain 0.03 and decay 0.35 through musicFilter. Add subtle kick? no.
- While slow, note duration? filter handles.
- Bass pulse every 4 steps at 55 Hz with gain 0.05.

Stop: clear interval; fade musicGain to 0 over .6s; stop after 1.2s using setTimeout; recreate bus on next start (drone oscillators). Ensure startMusic re-initializes.

Simplify: build music nodes in startMusic; stopMusic fades and stops, nulls. Music gain connected to master.

Persist mute: localStorage `borrowed-seconds-muted`; constructor reads. But audio init after; apply.

Also for mute button text updates in UI via main.

Let's write audio.js.

