```
Too many texts if holding 5s; only first debt toast. Text every second is okay but clutter; use text every 2nd? Keep small.

Debt update:
```js
this.debt.forEach(m => { if (m.fuse>0) m.fuse=Math.max(0, m.fuse-dt); });
const activeCollectors = this.enemies.reduce((n,e)=>n+(e.type==='collector'&&e.alive?1:0),0);
