content.text:
Add outer giant rings in drawArena. Put after boundary or before floor? After boundary. Let's add near end of drawArena before boss check:

```js
ctx.save();
ctx.globalCompositeOperation='lighter';
for (let i=0;i<3;i++){
 const rr=R*(1.22+i*.2);
 ctx.strokeStyle=`rgba(111,247,240,${0.035-i*0.008})`;
 ctx.setLineDash([2,14]);
 ctx.lineWidth=1;
 ctx.save(); ctx.rotate(t*(0.01+i*0.006)*(i%2?-1:1)); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(0,0,rr,t...); ctx.stroke(); ctx.restore();
}
ctx.restore();
```

Also stars alpha maybe currently visible. Fine.

Player size. Enemies glow and trails.

Husk detail: add arcs. Update drawHusk.

Also `drawPortal` for collectors renders label in world coords; okay.

Let's patch.

